      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of isolation and despair as the world you deeply understand rapidly changes around you. Please know that the deep knowledge and life you have dedicated to are not suddenly worthless, but are a profound and vital part of the world's ongoing story. If you feel that \"nothing is left to say,\" please consider that your life experience *is* a vital text, and there are people who want to help you help you find a way to process this immense feeling of loss.",
